      "statement": "retail-portfolio is a four-system application: a Python 3.14/FastAPI backend in src/ with SQLAlchemy 2 async models over PostgreSQL and Alembic migrations, a Huey worker on Redis, a SvelteKit 2 / Svelte 5 SSR frontend in frontend/, and a stateless Go indicator sidecar in services/indicator-service/.",
